SystemRequirements: libcurl (deb: libcurl4-openssl-dev, rpm:
    libcurl-devel). Optionally liboqs (>= 0.8) for the standardised
    post-quantum signature schemes ML-DSA (FIPS 204) and SLH-DSA (FIPS
    205); it is detected at configure time and the package builds
    without it, in which case the bundled hash-based scheme, which has
    no system dependency, remains available.
